{%- comment -%}
  Brand fonts, matching next/font/local output (docs/parity/font-fallbacks.md).
  Fallback faces are the metric-matched Arial faces Next generates, so layout
  is stable while the woff2 files load. Owned by the main session.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Hand-written preloads (not preload_tag): font preloads must carry crossorigin
  + type or the browser can't reuse them for the CORS @font-face fetch and
  downloads every face twice (Stage B L4: 7 font requests vs the reference's 4).
  Only clash-display-600 is preloaded: it is the face of the intro letters and the
  hero word, the text painted first. The other three faces still load through
  @font-face as soon as text uses them (the header is invisible during the intro,
  and the metric-matched fallbacks keep layout stable), so they no longer compete
  with the hero image for bandwidth on mobile.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% # theme-check-disable AssetPreload %}
<link rel="preload" href="{{ 'clash-display-600.woff2' | asset_url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{% # theme-check-enable AssetPreload %}
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "clashDisplay";
    src: url("{{ 'clash-display-600.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2");
    font-display: swap;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "clashDisplay";
    src: url("{{ 'clash-display-700.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2");
    font-display: swap;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "clashDisplay Fallback";
    src: local("Arial");
    ascent-override: 79.51%;
    descent-override: 22.33%;
    line-gap-override: 8.04%;
    size-adjust: 111.94%;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "satoshi";
    src: url("{{ 'satoshi-400.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2");
    font-display: swap;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "satoshi";
    src: url("{{ 'satoshi-500.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2");
    font-display: swap;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "satoshi Fallback";
    src: local("Arial");
    ascent-override: 102.23%;
    descent-override: 24.29%;
    line-gap-override: 10.12%;
    size-adjust: 98.80%;
  }
</style>
